# The normal wallpaper path is shared by the grid, shelves and return navigation.
phase SetClock
press a
phase Shelf
snap grid-first
press r1
snap grid-second
press down
snap grid-pico8
press l1
press up
press a
snap opened-shelf
press b
snap returned-grid
press menu
phase QuickMenu
press b
phase Shelf
snap returned-from-menu
press x
# Live-search keyboard is changing; capture it for review until new goldens are approved.
grab search-keyboard
press a
grab live-search-one-character
press x
grab live-search-cleared
press b
snap cancelled-search
